<?>        Help              <m>        Move mail         <0> Mail
<t>        Read / unread     <c>        Compose mail      <2> Contacts
<ctrl-d>   Delete mail       <n>        New directory
<enter>    Unfold / read     <ctrl-c>   Twice to quit
<h/H>      HTML / remote     <ctrl-r>   Sync mail
</>        Local search

